{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104182","id":2395456761,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Ox8T5","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104182","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104182.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104182.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104182","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104182/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104182/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104182/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8c14766597803b410bd5ea3d72660ab6265baa95","number":104182,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add missing `String + char *` function, to avoid unnecessary right side allocation to `String`.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I found this when profiling tps-demo.\r\n\r\nAdding this function:\r\n- Reduces tps-demo string allocations throughout a launch from `~1577153` to `~1470533` (~7%).\r\n- Reduces the size of Godot from 173,4mb to 172,7 (0.7mb, 0.4%).\r\n\r\nIt does not affect launch times (as much as I can measure).\r\n\r\nThe function has never existed (I think), so I recommend cherry-picking this to relevant branches.\r\n\r\n## Explanation\r\nBecause this function was missing, callers needed to implicitly upgrade the right hand side of `String + char *` to `String` temporarily, like here:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0028fd625e2c5b202e204bc12828cbca043213d3/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shader_rd.cpp#L99\r\n\r\nThis resulted in hundreds of thousands of unnecessary allocations.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7008779076,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABocF7RA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.3","name":"cherrypick:4.3","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.3.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.4.x release","colo